{"records":[{"findings":[{"actual_failure":"The output has no banner-unconfirmed element although the real charter is not confirmed.","affected_acceptance_criteria":["banner-charter-scope"],"evidence_refs":["packs/architect/.apm/skills/architect-assess/scripts/render_html.py:268"],"finding_id":"ADV-1","material":true,"observation":"The charter scanner and parse() disagree on where a fence closes, so a planted fence pair in an earlier section hides the real Checkpoints line.","reachable_path":"assessment.md text in Bottom line holds a fence, an info-string fence line, a fake charter with Checkpoints: confirmed, then the real charter says accepted-without-pause; render_html.py main renders and exits 0.","rule_ref":"banner decision uses only charter lines outside fenced blocks","schema_version":1},{"actual_failure":"The page shows an orientation subsection with no Sources checked table.","affected_acceptance_criteria":["provenance-gate"],"evidence_refs":["packs/architect/.apm/skills/architect-assess/scripts/render_html.py:287"],"finding_id":"ADV-3","material":true,"observation":"A level-3 heading with closing hashes or another level is not recognized as an orientation subsection, so the gate never runs.","reachable_path":"assessment.md holds `### Overall architecture ###` followed by prose and no table; the renderer exits 0.","rule_ref":"an orientation subsection needs a usable Sources checked table","schema_version":1},{"actual_failure":"An out-of-set evidence class renders unshaded with exit 0.","affected_acceptance_criteria":["evidence-class-refusal"],"evidence_refs":["packs/architect/.apm/skills/architect-assess/scripts/render_html.py:300"],"finding_id":"ADV-4","material":true,"observation":"Evidence classes are validated only on a subsection's final table, but earlier tables after a Sources checked label are still treated as sources tables.","reachable_path":"An orientation subsection holds a labeled table with the class `guessed`, a paragraph, then a valid final table; the renderer exits 0.","rule_ref":"every Sources checked row has an evidence class from the closed set","schema_version":1},{"actual_failure":"The banner-off criterion is not pinned.","affected_acceptance_criteria":["banner-charter-scope"],"evidence_refs":["packs/architect/tests/skills/architect-assess/test_render_html.py:370"],"finding_id":"ADV-5","material":true,"observation":"No test places Checkpoints: confirmed in the charter and again elsewhere.","reachable_path":"A renderer that counts every such line in the document passes all banner tests.","rule_ref":"tests can fail for a wrong implementation","schema_version":1},{"actual_failure":"The no-echo criterion is not pinned for refusal paths.","affected_acceptance_criteria":["fixed-token-output"],"evidence_refs":["packs/architect/tests/skills/architect-assess/test_render_html.py:410"],"finding_id":"ADV-6","material":true,"observation":"The fixed-token test only checks a line prefix, so an echoed path would pass.","reachable_path":"A renderer printing the effort path after the unsafe-path token passes the test.","rule_ref":"tokens on stdout and stderr come from a fixed set","schema_version":1}],"lineage":{"producer":"adversarial-reviewer","review_policy_fingerprint":"review-policy-sha256:7abdc66504438809f21f14f2b3b75b377c46a6d0f7e447d1c0fa99be472c075b","sequence":1,"source_event_id":"adv-review-1"},"report_id":"rep-adv-1","role":"adversarial-reviewer","schema_version":1,"subject":{"delivery_subject_ref":{"acceptance_fingerprint":"b4562c8b0f685ae78368d5a2916963544f746ed8bd0ab3972c4509c77f698a77","subject_id":"run-0085c7c3e1ec296b"},"lineage":{"projection_version":"1.0","provider":"core-review-subject-projector"},"normalized_paths":[".claude-plugin/marketplace.json","docs/product/changelog.d/9e3ac124-95a4-4470-a543-9884d8f9258f.md","guides/architect/how-to/assess-a-repository.md","guides/architect/reference/architecture-assessment.md","packs/architect/.apm/skills/architect-assess/SKILL.md","packs/architect/.a